flowchart TD
  A[Scan and register bean definitions] --> B[BeanFactoryPostProcessors, ConfigurationClassPostProcessor, property binding]
  B --> C[Instantiate bean: constructor injection]
  C --> D[Populate: field and setter injection]
  D --> E[Aware callbacks: BeanNameAware, BeanFactoryAware]
  E --> F[BeanPostProcessor before-init]
  F --> G[PostConstruct then afterPropertiesSet then init-method]
  G --> H[BeanPostProcessor after-init: AOP proxy created here]
  H --> I[Singleton ready in the container]
  I --> J[SmartInitializingSingleton, ContextRefreshedEvent, ApplicationRunner]
  J --> K[Application serves traffic]
  K --> L[Context close: PreDestroy then DisposableBean.destroy]
